(text "KEYED SLOT: H1 engages the carrier M3 x 25 post before electrical contact.\nAll headers and passives factory fitted. No user soldering or antenna-selector rework.\nPower declarations describe power arriving through the slot and buck output after L1.\nLayout authorized; no fabrication release. See DESIGN_REVIEW.md." (at 20.32 267 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b3ab83d6-a65b-5564-8c16-6f23a2bd3356"))
